Journey: Slow and changing pages
Tags: @the-internet
Base URL: https://the-internet.herokuapp.com

Open /dynamic_loading/1
Click the "Start" button
  Expect the page contains "Hello World!"
Open /dynamic_loading/2
Click the "Start" button
Wait for the text "Hello World!"

Open /dynamic_controls
Click the "Remove" button
  Expect the page contains "It's gone!"
Click the "Enable" button
  Expect the page contains "It's enabled!"
Type "typed after enabling" into the field inside #input-example
  Expect the value of the field inside #input-example is "typed after enabling"

Open /notification_message_rendered
Click the "Click here" link
  Expect #flash contains "Action"

Open /entry_ad
If the "Close" text is visible then click the "Close" text
Expect the page contains "Entry Ad"

Open /infinite_scroll
Scroll down until the "Infinite Scroll" heading is visible
Repeat 4 times
  Scroll to the bottom
  Wait 1 second
End
Expect the number of css=.jscroll-added is at least 4

Open /exit_intent
Move the mouse to 600, 300
Move the mouse to 600, -5
  Expect the page contains "It's commonly used to encourage a user to take an action"
Click the "Close" text
